{"municipality_code":"03501","pref":"岩手県","city":"軽米町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"軽米町には、狄塚村、山内村、晴山村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「小軽米城跡」、「駒板遺跡」、「皂角子久保VI遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、狄塚村や山内村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 「晴山館址」や「乃木将軍愛馬雷号の墓」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":39,"rank":934,"percentile":50.3,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":34,"rank":745,"percentile":59.7,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":15,"rank":491,"percentile":71.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":6,"rank":699,"percentile":57.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":10,"rank":1140,"percentile":37.1,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["晴山館址","乃木将軍愛馬雷号の墓"],"food_culture":["ひっつみ／ひっつみ汁（伝承地域: 県央地域を中心に県